      "text": "Day 12 · Breakfast and transfer to the bus station for the scenic journey from Cusco to Puno, with stops at cultural sites such as Pikillaqta, the baroque church of Andahuaylillas and the Temple of Wiracocha at Raqchi, and lunch in Sicuani. The bus then climbs to the high pass of La Raya, at more than 4,300 metres, where the scenery changes dramatically. Arrival in Puno, reception and transfer to the hotel.",
